" class="r-1ods13g"><div data-rid="90483f45-37a2-4c73-a648-287546c81b80" class="r-9r161q"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1p4l70l" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0m-3.97-3.03a.75.75 0 0 0-1.08.022L7.477 9.417 5.384 7.323a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06L6.97 11.03a.75.75 0 0 0 1.079-.02l3.992-4.99a.75.75 0 0 0-.01-1.05z"></path></svg></div><div data-rid="7b7a5bc4-4a4d-407c-ab58-cb8f0ef83704" class="r-cn280t alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Jane D.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4c382ddc-9595-4605-94a6-f35a8b45b7f9" class="r-lpu7xu"><div data-rid="6d84f88f-0f37-4b53-bd19-8840818dd73d" class="r-1w3zhy4"><div data-rid="cfb5c1c3-4a7b-491f-a514-342e1ada2d05" class="r-1n2ttp6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>5.</p></span></div><div data-rid="20a2b65c-ba1f-4ac6-9b03-5662645b3759" class="r-1mb5gc4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>It's Reusable! No Plastic Waste</p></span></div><div data-rid="f6781ed8-091c-4b0b-a476-41e34445d5f6" class="r-9f9bd5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Every part of the Magic Water Elf Kit is designed to be safe for kids <em>and</em> gentle on the planet. The powder is made from food-grade calcium lactate (commonly used in cheese and fruit preservation), while the gels come from sodium alginate a natural compound derived from seaweed. It’s 100% non-toxic, biodegradable, and completely reusable.</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="898a72c6-b73d-4de4-9493-ec21f420e7a1" class="r-1yoxq01"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/f883d5ab-79a6-45c1-8315-7641064b65d1/6132de9b-8077-4c96-9a12-54f25ce6538d?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/f883d5ab-79a6-45c1-8315-7641064b65d1/6132de9b-8077-4c96-9a12-54f25ce6538d?width=1024" media="(